{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40075","headline":"东风解冻省试 · 徐夤","name":"东风解冻省试","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暖气飘苹末，冻痕销水中。\n扇冰初觉泮，吹海旋成空。\n入律三春照，朝宗万里通。\n岸分天影阔，色照日光融。\n波起轻摇绿，鳞游乍跃红。\n殷勤排弱羽，飞翥趂和风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40075.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40075","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}